OL,5,G0800 Cruising with Jane McDonald
OL,6,     FJane McDonald sails around South
OL,7,     FAmerica in style aboard a luxury
OL,8,     Fship. She begins her journey south
OL,9,     Falong the Chilean coast.
OL,10,G0900 Cruising with Jane McDonald
OL,11,     FIn Argentina, Jane visits a Welsh
OL,12,     Fsettlement in Patagonia and
OL,13,     Flocations associated with Eva
OL,14,     FPeron in Buenos Aires, then heads
OL,15,     Ffor Punta Del Este and Montevideo
OL,16,     Fin Uruguay.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/10
