OL,5,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FExtreme weather conditions play a
OL,7,     Frole in the death or serious
OL,8,     Finjury of four people a day on
OL,9,     FUK's roads. In this edition, cops
OL,10,     Fdeal with dangerous drivers who
OL,11,     Fput lives at risk.
OL,12,G1400 Traffic Cops
OL,13,     FAn estimated #10 billion worth of
OL,14,     Fillegal drugs are sold in the UK
OL,15,     Fevery year. In this episode, cops
OL,16,     Fcrack down on drug gangs ruling
OL,17,     Fthrough fear and dealers cashing
OL,18,     Fin on victims.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG3/10
