OL,5,G1500 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FWith Derbyshire bordered by seven
OL,7,     Fcounties, policing its roads for
OL,8,     Fcriminals on the move is hard. In
OL,9,     Fthis edition cops investigate a
OL,10,     Fpossible cloned vehicle and seek a
OL,11,     Fstolen caravan.
OL,12,G1600 Traffic Cops
OL,13,     FWith reoffending rates on the rise
OL,14,     Fin the UK, we follow the Traffic
OL,15,     FCops as they are increasingly
OL,16,     Ffaced with seasoned criminals,
OL,17,     Fexperienced at evading the law.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG4/10
