OL,5,G1900 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FJim and Lisa direct an
OL,7,     Fintelligence-led strike. Suspects
OL,8,     Fare on the move; it's believed
OL,9,     Fthey're in possession of a handgun
OL,10,     Fand ammunition. The Knife Crime
OL,11,     FTeam target drug hotspots.
OL,12,G2000 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FOfficers investigate reports of
OL,14,     Fsomeone brandishing a 12-inch
OL,15,     Fblade on a residential estate, and
OL,16,     Fhunt down a driver who's caused a
OL,17,     Fcrash driving the wrong way on a
OL,18,     Fdual carriageway.
