OL,5,G2100 Call the Bailiffs: Time to...
OL,6,     F...Pay Up! From early-morning
OL,7,     Fstakeouts to high-value commercial
OL,8,     Fdebts, agents track a debtor who
OL,9,     Fowes service charges and help a
OL,10,     Fhotel guest claim compensation for
OL,11,     Flost luggage.
OL,12,G2200 999: Emergency Call Out
OL,13,     FThe Kent Joint Response Unit
OL,14,     Farrives at the scene of a rollover
OL,15,     Fin a residential area; a paramedic
OL,16,     Fgets police protection when
OL,17,     Ftreating a stabbing victim.
