OL,5,G2300 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FStaff struggle with a disruptive
OL,7,     Fpatient at Newham Hospital A&E,
OL,8,     Fwhile in Norwich doctors assess an
OL,9,     F84-year-old woman after a head
OL,10,     Finjury leaves her confused and
OL,11,     Fvomiting.
OL,12,G0000 Fatal First Dates
OL,13,     FA dream vacation ends in tragedy
OL,14,     Fwhen a young British woman
OL,15,     Ftravelling to New Zealand is lured
OL,16,     Finto what appears to be an
OL,17,     Finnocent date by a violent online
OL,18,     Fpredator.
