OL,5,G0100 Acts of Murder
OL,6,     FTed Bundy was one of the world's
OL,7,     Fmost notorious serial killers,
OL,8,     Faccused of murdering at least 30
OL,9,     Fyoung women and girls. Three super
OL,10,     Fsleuths expose the lies behind a
OL,11,     Fkiller's performance. (Ep1)
OL,12,G0200 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FDr Toby Nelson checks a patient's
OL,14,     Fback and finds a pre-cancerous
OL,15,     Fmole, Dr Emma McMullen inspects a
OL,16,     Flipoma on a patient's buttock, and
OL,17,     FDr Dev Shah treats a collection of
OL,18,     Fskin tags.
